{{also|bara|Bara|bára|Bára|bāra|barā|båra|bæra|bara-}}
==Swedish==

===Etymology===
{{root|sv|ine-pro|*bʰer-}}
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|bæra}}, from {{inh|sv|non|bera}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*beraną}}, from {{der|sv|ine-pro|*bʰer-}} (whence also {{l|sv|börja}}, {{l|sv|bår}} and {{l|sv|barn}}).
Cognate with {{cog|da|bære}} and {{cog|no|bære}}. <ref>{{R:runeberg.org|svetym|0166.html bära}}</ref>

See the English verb {{m|en|bear}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|sv|Sv-bära.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{sv-verb-irr|bär|bar|burit|bär}}

